      ],
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "reasoning", "reference": "Offset sync is needed only once, at cutover"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R01-rollback",
      "action": "Only if a check after C03 fails: scale both services to 0, patch both ConfigMaps back to redpanda:29092, revert the two values files, and scale back to 1. Leave MM2 running until the Redpanda groups are back to lag 0. Report that image-service may reprocess catalog.product.events records that were mirrored back to Redpanda while it ran on Kafka.",
